/tmp/
/repos/
/.vscode/
/lab/research/claude-code-docs/
/lab/research/claude-code-mods/docs/
/lab/research/skill-curation/agentskills-*.md
/lab/research/skill-curation/claude-agent-skill-best-practices.md

# Flow: .flow/ holds the tickets, checked out from the branch "flow", which
# shares no history with the code. Every branch sees the same tickets, and
# none of them is ever merged in.
.flow/

tmp/
node_modules
# A skill belonging to this project lives here as a real folder, committed. A
# source's skill or a private one is a symlink holding this machine's path, which
# would load nothing on the next machine, so these two lines ignore links and
# track folders. Which skills are on lives in "skills" in .flow/settings.json.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/*/
